---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Whoami</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 mb-10">Harshal Pandya • Blue Team focused</p>

    <section class="space-y-6 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        I am building toward roles in <strong class="text-white">SOC Analysis</strong>, 
        <strong class="text-white">Incident Response</strong>, 
        <strong class="text-white">Digital Forensics</strong>, and 
        <strong class="text-white">Threat Hunting / OSINT</strong>.
      </p>

      <p>
        My approach is simple: every lab and every room is treated as a real security incident. 
        I don’t stop at root or the flag. I investigate the full attack chain, extract IOCs, 
        map the timeline, and write a formal incident report the way a real IR team would.
      </p>

      <p>
        This portfolio exists to show that process — technical skill combined with clear, 
        professional documentation.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-14">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">Current Focus</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-400">
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-500">→</span> Endpoint & Network Forensics</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-500">→</span> Phishing & Email Threat Analysis</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-500">→</span> Incident Documentation & Reporting</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-cyan-500">→</span> Threat Intelligence & IOC Extraction</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
